{
  "id": "chimney_sizing",
  "title": "Chimney Sizing",
  "description": "Calculate chimney draft and required chimney area based on height, temperature difference, air density, and flue gas volume.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Chimney Sizing Calculator\n\nThe capacity of a chimney depends on the potential chimney draft - the pressure difference created by the inside and outside air temperature difference and chimney height - and the chimney area.\n\n### Chimney Draft Formula\n\n**dp_ch = h × ρo × (1 - To / Ti) × ag**\n\nWhere:\n- **dp_ch** = pressure draft in the chimney (Pa)\n- **h** = height of chimney (m)\n- **ρo** = ambient outside density of air (kg/m³)\n- **Ti** = absolute inside chimney temperature (K)\n- **To** = absolute outside air temperature (K)\n- **ag** = acceleration of gravity (9.81 m/s²)\n\n### Chimney Area Formula\n\n**A = Q / v**\n\nWhere:\n- **A** = cross-sectional area of chimney (m²)\n- **Q** = volume of flue gases at chimney temperature (m³/s)\n- **v** = velocity (m/s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "h",
          "label": "Chimney Height",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "rho_o",
          "label": "Outside Air Density",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1.292,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        },
        {
          "id": "ti",
          "label": "Inside Chimney Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 200,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "to",
          "label": "Outside Air Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "Q",
          "label": "Volume of Flue Gases",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "m³/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "v",
          "label": "Design Velocity",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2,
          "unit": "m/s"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "Ti_K",
          "label": "Inside Temperature (Absolute)",
          "formula": "inputs.ti + 273",
          "unit": "K",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "To_K",
          "label": "Outside Temperature (Absolute)",
          "formula": "inputs.to + 273",
          "unit": "K",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "dpch",
          "label": "Chimney Draft Pressure",
          "formula": "inputs.h * inputs.rho_o * (1 - (inputs.to + 273) / (inputs.ti + 273)) * 9.81",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "A",
          "label": "Required Chimney Area",
          "formula": "inputs.Q / inputs.v",
          "unit": "m²",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "A_mm2",
          "label": "Required Chimney Area",
          "formula": "(inputs.Q / inputs.v) * 1000000",
          "unit": "mm²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Value",
        "Unit",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Chimney Height",
          "20",
          "m",
          "Height of chimney structure"
        ],
        [
          "Outside Air Density",
          "1.292",
          "kg/m³",
          "Ambient outside air density"
        ],
        [
          "Inside Temperature",
          "200",
          "°C",
          "Flue gas temperature inside chimney"
        ],
        [
          "Outside Temperature",
          "0",
          "°C",
          "Ambient outside air temperature"
        ],
        [
          "Gravity Acceleration",
          "9.81",
          "m/s²",
          "Standard acceleration due to gravity"
        ],
        [
          "Design Velocity (min)",
          "2",
          "m/s",
          "Minimum velocity for smaller furnaces"
        ],
        [
          "Design Velocity (max)",
          "10",
          "m/s",
          "Maximum velocity for larger furnaces"
        ],
        [
          "Area per kW",
          "1100",
          "mm²/kW",
          "Standard chimney area requirement per kW of boiler heat"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}